git-annex 10.20261020 released with [[!toggle text="these changes"]]
[[!toggleable text="""  * adjust --hide-unwanted: New option to make an adjusted branch
    containing only wanted files.
  * push: Force push to remote git-annex branch when it has been
    supersceded by a transition.
  * Fix handling of --sameas special remotes with onlyencryptcreds=yes.
  * Linux standalone builds bundled CA certs updated for
    EMudhra Intermediate CA Compromise."""]]